// Preset: Acrylic
// Tags: Acrylic, Accent tint
// About: Acrylic tinted with the accent colour (README screenshot).
// Source: moudey, Nilesoft Shell discussion #174
// https://github.com/moudey/Shell/discussions/174, the "Acrylic" block, which the
// maintainer says to add to the theme section. screenshots/acrylic.png shows it.
theme
{
    background
    {
        opacity=0
        effect=[3, color.accent, 50]
    }
}
